  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/main.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>Ваше личное безопасное* хранилище.</div>\n<div>*Хранилище может быть не на 100% безопасным. Monobank Inc. не несёт ответственности за кражу или утрату личного имущества.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Monobank позволяет безопасно хранить большое количество одинаковых предметов.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/desc.png\" alt=\"Описание\" width=\"1000\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/unlocking.png\" alt=\"Разблокировка\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/lock_replacement.png\" alt=\"Замена замка\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/vault.png\" alt=\"Хранилище\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/vaults.png\" alt=\"Хранилища\" width=\"1000\" height=\"491\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Monobank/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/additional.png\" alt=\"Дополнительная информация\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">Обзор от <strong>Mischief of Mice:</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wG-sgxrlkfM?si=k1_TbHY6cVGLljkt\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Сервер Discord\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Нравится мод?&nbsp;Ваша поддержка позволит мне продолжать работу над ним и над другими модами!</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Посмотрите другие мои моды:</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
